{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31159","headline":"答贾支使寄鹤 · 薛能","name":"答贾支使寄鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑞羽奇姿踉跄形，称爲仙驭过清冥。\n何年厚禄曾居卫，几世前身本姓丁。\n幸有远云兼远水，莫临华表望华亭。\n劳君赠我清歌侣，将去田园夜坐听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}